Description: Extracts parameter estimates and diagnostics from 'NONMEM'
    listing files for population pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic analyses.
    Returns fixed-effect estimates, random-effect variance diagonals, standard
    errors, relative standard errors, objective function values, eigenvalue-based
    condition numbers, and shrinkage in tidy tables or scalar values. Missing
    optional quantities are represented by NA; a combined parser preserves
    partial results when individual sections cannot be parsed. An optional
    'shiny' application supports file uploads and table downloads. Parsing
    existing listing files does not require a 'NONMEM' installation.
